# P7: an Xid 79 latches needs-reboot; a Monado crash is not restarted; the user's explicit forced start passes once
# (user decision 9: --force past needs-reboot is allowed, with a warning).
start desk
at 5 klog NVRM: Xid (PCI:0000:01:00): 79, GPU has fallen off the bus.
at 10 exit monado sig=6
at 10 down wayvr passthrough ctrltrack perf
expect 11 gate needs-reboot
expect 100 runs 0
expect 100 notified VR runtime not restarted: the GPU needs a reboot
at 110 cmd force-start
expect 112 ran start monado
